{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-4-1","title":"Zechariah 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 By the golden candlestick is foreshewn the good success of Zerubbabel's foundation; 11 by the two olive trees the two anointed ones.</p>\n<p>the angel. 1:9,13,19; 2:3; 3:6,7 waked. 1Ki 19:5-7; Jer 31:26; Da 8:18; 10:8-10; Lu 9:32; 22:45,46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-2","title":"Zechariah 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>What. 5:2; Jer 1:11-13 a candlestick. Ex 25:31-38; 37:17-24; 40:24,25; 1Ki 7:49,50; 1Ch 28:15; 2Ch 4:7 2Ch 4:20-22; 13:11; Jer 52:19; Mt 5:14-16; Re 1:12,20; 2:1 a bowl. Heb. her bowl. 1Ki 7:50 seven. Ex 25:37; Re 4:5 seven pipes to the seven camps. or, seven several pipes to thelamps, etc. 12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-3","title":"Zechariah 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>11,12,14; Jud 9:9; Ro 11:17,24; Re 11:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-4","title":"Zechariah 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>What. 12-14; 1:9,19; 5:6; 6:4; Da 7:16-19; 12:8; Mt 13:36; Re 7:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-5","title":"Zechariah 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Knowest. 13; Mr 4:13 No. Ge 41:16; Ps 139:6; Da 2:30; 1Co 2:12-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-6","title":"Zechariah 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Not. 9:13-15; Nu 27:16; 2Ch 14:11; Isa 11:2-4; 30:1; 32:15; 63:10-14 Eze 37:11-14; Ho 1:7; Hag 2:2-5; 1Co 2:4,5; 2Co 10:4,5; 1Pe 1:12 might. or, army. 2Ch 32:7,8; Ps 20:6-8; 33:16,20,21; 44:3-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-7","title":"Zechariah 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>O great. 14:4,5; Ps 114:4,6; Isa 40:3,4; 41:15; 64:1-3; Jer 51:25; Da 2:34,35 Mic 1:4; 4:1; Na 1:5,6; Hab 3:6; Hag 2:6-9,21-23; Mt 21:21; Lu 3:5 Re 16:20 headstone. 9; Ps 118:22; Isa 28:16; Mt 21:42; Mr 12:10; Lu 20:17; Ac 4:11 Eph 2:20; 1Pe 2:7 shoutings. Ezr 3:11-13; 6:15-17; Job 38:6,7; Re 5:9-13; 19:1-6 Grace. Jer 33:11; Ro 11:6; Eph 1:6,7; 2:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-9","title":"Zechariah 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>have. Ezr 3:8-13; 5:16 his hands. 6:12,13; Ezr 6:14,15; Mt 16:18; Heb 12:2 and. 2:8,9,11; 6:15; Isa 48:16; Joh 3:17; 5:36,37; 8:16-18; 17:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-10","title":"Zechariah 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>despised. Ezr 3:12,13; Ne 4:2-4; Job 8:7; Pr 4:18; Da 2:34,35; Ho 6:3; Hag 2:3 Mt 13:31-33; 1Co 1:28,29 for they, etc. or, since the seven eyes of the Lord shallrejoice. Isa 66:11,14; Lu 15:5-10,32 and shall. Am 7:7,8 plummet. Heb. stone of tin. those. 3:9; Re 8:2 they are. 1:10,11; 2Ch 16:9; Pr 15:3; Re 5:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-11","title":"Zechariah 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>What. 3; Re 11:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-12","title":"Zechariah 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>What be. Mt 20:23; Re 11:4 through. Hag 1:1; *marg: Heb. by the hand of. empty, etc. or, empty out of themselvesoil into gold. the golden. Heb. the gold.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-13","title":"Zechariah 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Knowest. 5; Heb 5:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-4-14","title":"Zechariah 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>These. 6:13; Ex 29:7; 40:15; Le 8:12; 1Sa 10:1; 16:1,12,13; Ps 2:6; *marg: Ps 89:20; 110:4; Isa 61:1-3; Da 9:24-26; Hag 1:1-12; Heb 1:8,9 Heb 7:1,2; Re 11:4 anointed ones. Heb. sons of oil. Isa 5:1; *marg: that. 3:1-7; 6:5; De 10:8; 1Ki 17:1; Jer 49:19; Lu 1:19 the Lord. Jos 3:11,13; Isa 54:5; Mic 4:13</p>"}]}